# Every unique interviewer line spoken in the 2026-10-17 text rehearsals (DeepSeek, Haiku, Luna, Laguna, GLM talkers),
# labelled by hand. Labels: promise (defers a topic the candidate raised), pullback (returns to a question it already asked),
# format_confirm (asks whether the round format is okay), narration (speaks its own reasoning or process), tool_leak (a tool
# call written as speech), stumble (an aborted start repaired with '... I mean,'), planned_later ('I'd planned to ask that later').
# An unlabelled line is a negative for every classifier. Change a label only with a reason in the commit.
